      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.11,
      "end_seconds": 209.12,
      "duration_seconds": 8.01,
      "text": "That's all I needed to check. Right, here's what I'm thinking. This looks most like palpitations with an unclear cause."
