      "start_seconds": 237.66,
      "end_seconds": 261.85,
      "duration_seconds": 24.19,
      "text": "let's book a thyroid test to look into palpitations i'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more let's book an ECG to look into palpitations you'll be taking metoprolol, 25 milligrams, twice a day, until we review that should help with palpitations"
