      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.64,
      "end_seconds": 297.27,
      "duration_seconds": 25.63,
      "text": "cut back on tea coffee and energy drinks and note the time whenever it happens cut back on tea coffee and fizzy drinks for a couple of weeks and see how things settle please don't wait if you faint or have chest pain with the racing that's when to be seen urgently"
